tool.help:
@GENEFIOR_HELP@
**Gene Stats**
GeneFior-Gene-Stats generates gene-level coverage visualisations and read exports from prior GeneFíor or AMRfior results. It produces PNG plots showing per-base coverage across detected genes, and can optionally export deduplicated read names and read sequences.
Provide the detection matrix (and optionally the evidence matrix, evidence summary, and allele resolution) from a previous run, optionally specify gene names or selection criteria, and the tool will generate plots and read exports.
@ATTRIBUTION@
